# Widen a live workspace and shadow a table (proposed)
// "Follow-ups for MB Code: backend". changeWorkspaceSchemas, shadowTable and unshadowTable are
// x-status: proposed, so this flow only passes in a view that includes proposed.
agent -> parent: changeWorkspaceSchemas {databases.input_schemas}
agent -> parent: getWorkspaceConfig
agent -> sidecar: shadowTable {id, to_schema, to_table_name}
agent -> sidecar: unshadowTable
